     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">I have created a line graph and now I wish to make the graph interactive by using sliders.</p><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">sliderInput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;dd&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">&quot;Time Range&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> min </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">1000</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> max </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">130000</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> value </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">2000</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(125,39,39)\">10000</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">))</span></code></pre><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">This is my line in the ui for the slider.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">The graph originally is created like follows without reactive input:</p><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">df </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> data.frame</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">xrange</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">d</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\n\r\noutput</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">lineChart </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> renderPlot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">({</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">\r\nggplot</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">df</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">aes</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">=</span><span s